{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04186","headline":"久客临海有怀 · 骆宾王","name":"久客临海有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天涯非日观，地屺望星楼。\n练光摇乱马，剑气上连牛。\n草湿姑苏夕，叶下洞庭秋。\n欲知凄断意，江上涉安流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}